# Only application source and the dependency lock are sent to the builder.
# In particular .env, local databases, report assets, and Render secret files
# are excluded even if they exist in the repository/build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.lock.txt
!backend/
!backend/**
!frontend/
!frontend/**
!scripts/
!scripts/container_start.py
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
